{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1061362/block/singleImage/3254369/df/01KZQ0DPDDG8RFS473CJ48BKNY.jpg?updatedAt=1793501145\"/><figcaption>男童送往瑪麗醫院治理。</figcaption></figure><p>西營盤發生虐兒案。今日(11月1日)凌晨近1時，警方接獲一名女子報案，指其14歲兒子懷疑遭其35歲前夫不恰當對待。警方接報到場，經初步調查，懷疑男子曾以手襲擊兒子，以涉嫌「對所看管兒童或少年人虐待或忽略」拘捕該名男子，現正被扣留調查。</p><p>案中男童眼部、手部和額頭受傷，清醒送往瑪麗醫院治理；據報案件涉管教問題。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:02.868110+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T02:20:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:08.970628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:46.638473+00:00","content_hash":"b2d9358b1fadc633f238fda1e974cf812ec03f81549788b8a4a419c2b9138250","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:02.868110+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}